#ASSERT `s 859L(5) the registrar must include the entry in the register` (JUST TRUE) `s 859L(5)(b) a statement of the fact that all or part of the property or undertaking has been released from the charge or has ceased to form part of the company's property or undertaking` EQUALS JUST TRUE
